{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115618",
      "title": "Using Host Elements Like Regular Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 114,
      "videoOrder": 108,
      "sourceHash": "e9320385176524dc2f4ee42e01c7b03e39f5a8399c919a0bac701ef57dd8a3da",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "So Components have a host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 6.96,
          "en": "Every Component has a host element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "and as you learn, it's simply the element that's targeted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 12.243,
          "en": "by the Component selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 18.08,
          "en": "Now this host element feature is really important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.24,
          "end": 19.073,
          "en": "to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.073,
          "end": 20.97,
          "en": "It is important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.97,
          "end": 25.56,
          "en": "that what you select here is actually rendered to the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.56,
          "end": 30.45,
          "en": "That there is a app control element in the dom of the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.45,
          "end": 33.183,
          "en": "that's visited by the browser, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "And we can often use this to our advantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 40.83,
          "en": "For example, here in this control Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.83,
          "end": 45.83,
          "en": "I wrap my label and NG content with this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.237,
          "end": 48,
          "en": "Now that is fine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48,
          "end": 51.197,
          "en": "but if you then inspect this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.197,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "you, of course see that in that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 57.96,
          "en": "for every control we have app control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.96,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "so our host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 62.67,
          "en": "And then in there the paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.67,
          "end": 65.49,
          "en": "and then in there the label and the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.49,
          "end": 67.672,
          "en": "That of course works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.672,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "but this paragraph is kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 73.277,
          "en": "of an unnecessary element in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.277,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "We don't need that many levels of nesting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "Why don't we just put the label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 83.043,
          "en": "and input directly into this app control element?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.63,
          "end": 86.16,
          "en": "Well, we can of course do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.16,
          "end": 88.83,
          "en": "We can remove this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.83,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "but if we do that, then we'll break our styles again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 96.03,
          "en": "because in the control Components CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.03,
          "end": 100.35300000000001,
          "en": "I'm looking for elements with control as a class on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 105.757,
          "en": "So therefore, if I reload now, the styles are broken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.757,
          "end": 107.283,
          "en": "as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.53999999999999,
          "end": 112.05,
          "en": "But of course you'll also already know the workaround.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.05,
          "end": 114.93,
          "en": "Instead of targeting control here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 117.34100000000001,
          "en": "we can target colon host",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.34100000000001,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "so that we look for labels and inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "and text areas inside of our host element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 127.353,
          "en": "so inside of the app dash control element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.94,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "And if we do that and save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 134.043,
          "en": "it's still broken somehow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 137.04,
          "en": "Well now it's broken here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.04,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "because for this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 143.88,
          "en": "we disabled view encapsulation, we set it to none.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.88,
          "end": 146.76,
          "en": "Now as a result, this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.76,
          "end": 150.12,
          "en": "of course, still has a host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.12,
          "end": 153.87,
          "en": "We saw that in the dom before. It is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 157.89,
          "en": "But this host CSS selector won't work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.89,
          "end": 159.69,
          "en": "because these styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.69,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "of this component are indeed no longer scoped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 168.18,
          "en": "Instead, they are applied as global styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.18,
          "end": 169.71,
          "en": "to the entire page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.71,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "as if you would've put them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 175.02,
          "en": "into the styles.CSS file in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.02,
          "end": 177.87,
          "en": "And therefore there is no real connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.87,
          "end": 181.464,
          "en": "between these styles and these CSS rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.464,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "and the component to which you attach them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "That's why this host selector doesn't target",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.46,
          "end": 190.56,
          "en": "this component's host element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 193.473,
          "en": "with view encapsulation set to none.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 196.74,
          "en": "So for this specific use case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.74,
          "end": 199.464,
          "en": "we can't use this host selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.464,
          "end": 202.47,
          "en": "but we can do something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.47,
          "end": 204.97,
          "en": "I'll go back to using dot control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.01,
          "end": 208.003,
          "en": "and we could now go to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.003,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "where we use app control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 214.833,
          "en": "So here in the new ticket Component HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.67000000000002,
          "end": 219.18200000000002,
          "en": "And add this control class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.18200000000002,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "because you can add extra attributes like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 224.67000000000002,
          "en": "on your Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.67000000000002,
          "end": 227.725,
          "en": "Even if they're not inputs of those Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.725,
          "end": 231.48,
          "en": "you can still add any attributes you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.48,
          "end": 235.464,
          "en": "They often just might not have any effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.464,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "But here it will have an effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "because by adding a class here, we're adding this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 244.563,
          "en": "which is wanted by the control Component CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.64,
          "end": 249,
          "en": "So by adding this class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249,
          "end": 251.821,
          "en": "to app control in the new ticket Component template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.821,
          "end": 256.203,
          "en": "if you save it, you'll get back the look you had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.54200000000003,
          "end": 259.98,
          "en": "So that is a possible solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.98,
          "end": 261.72,
          "en": "and it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.72,
          "end": 264.762,
          "en": "that you can add any attributes of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 264.762,
          "end": 267.573,
          "en": "to your own elements.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
